<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>My Simple HTML Blog</title>
    <style>
      /* Base Reset & Variables */
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      :root {
        --primary-color: #2c3e50;
        --accent-color: #e74c3c;
        --text-color: #333333;
        --bg-color: #f4f6f7;
        --card-bg: #ffffff;
      }
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--text-color);
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
      }

      /* Header & Navigation */
      header {
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: white;
        padding: 2rem 0;
        text-align: center;
      }
      header h1 {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
      nav {
        background-color: #34495e;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
      }
      nav a {
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        margin: 0 0.25rem;
        display: inline-block;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }
      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--accent-color);
      }

      /* Layout Container */
      .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding: 0 1rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      /* Main Content - Blog Posts List */
      main {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      article {
        background-color: var(--card-bg);
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }
      .post-meta {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #7f8c8d;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 0;
      }
      .post-meta span {
        margin-right: 1rem;
      }
      .post-excerpt {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .read-more-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: white;
        padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: background-color 0.3s;
      }
      .read-more-btn:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent-color);
      }

      /* Sidebar styling */
      aside {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      .sidebar-widget {
        background-color: var(--card-bg);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }
      .sidebar-widget h3 {
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .sidebar-widget ul {
        list-style: none;
      }
      .sidebar-widget ul li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      .sidebar-widget ul li a {
        color: var(--primary-color);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .sidebar-widget ul li a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      /* Footer styling */
      footer {
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 0;
        margin-top: 4rem;
      }

      /* Responsive Breakpoint */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .container {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <header>
      <h1>The Code Chronicles</h1>
      <p>Documenting the journey through web development and technology</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#articles">Articles</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content wrapper -->
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Blog feed entries -->
      <main id="articles">
        <!-- Article 1 -->
        <article>
          <h2>Getting Started with Semantic HTML5</h2>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span class="date">📅 October 20, 2026</span>
            <span class="author">👤 Jane Doe</span>
            <span class="category">🏷️ Web Dev</span>
          </div>
          <p class="post-excerpt">
            Semantic elements clearly describe their meaning to both the browser
            and the developer. Discover why structural tags like
            &lt;article&gt;, &lt;section&gt;, and &lt;aside&gt; matter more than
            ever for SEO and modern web structure...
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">Read Full Article</a>
        </article>

        <!-- Article 2 -->
        <article>
          <h2>Why CSS Grid Rules Layout Design</h2>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span class="date">📅 October 15, 2026</span>
            <span class="author">👤 John Smith</span>
            <span class="category">🏷️ CSS</span>
          </div>
          <p class="post-excerpt">
            Gone are the days of float fixes and complex absolute positioning
            hacks. Learn how CSS Grid offers a powerful two-dimensional
            grid-based layout system that makes complex responsive interfaces
            incredibly clean to write...
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">Read Full Article</a>
        </article>

        <!-- Article 3 -->
        <article>
          <h2>Mastering the Fundamentals of Web Accessibility</h2>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span class="date">📅 October 08, 2026</span>
            <span class="author">👤 Alex Rivera</span>
            <span class="category">🏷️ Accessibility</span>
          </div>
          <p class="post-excerpt">
            Building an inclusive web means engineering pages that anyone can
            read, navigate, and experience seamlessly. Let's look closely at alt
            text, focus state guidelines, and optimal contrast rules...
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">Read Full Article</a>
        </article>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar Panel -->
      <aside>
        <!-- About Section Widget -->
        <div class="sidebar-widget" id="about">
          <h3>About The Blog</h3>
          <p>
            Welcome! This space tracks daily learning metrics, code templates,
            and design experiments created directly with plain markup and modern
            styling strategies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Categories Widget -->
        <div class="sidebar-widget">
          <h3>Categories</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#">HTML & Design (12)</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">CSS System Styles (24)</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">JavaScript Core (18)</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">UI/UX Accessibility (7)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <!-- Page Footer -->
    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 The Code Chronicles. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
